354893_2123985974762689_1544591742969265917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eLfME6DFzLgQ7kNvwHtTrwx&_nc_oc=Ado3ZoiaXfBPnycYOxxlXXUbANfSIzeYVZcN4Tb0_Sg7t0HLultmi4kM3jBR_0SZuTs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQfbKWEoJ5RCvB1lMG3U6vtHz4KzvZSb8fvbqGEcfzdlQ&oe=6B0475E3"}, {"file_name": "image4.png", "id": "1479678613042418", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300750_1479678616375751_6997581480530838541_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HggzSUW2JxsQ7kNvwHZhWip&_nc_oc=Adpf-6Ao3OzWMi-cGiaEKMzmETVivIRMSAruJWpuizJ-eIpWrtoZoThLVXKPS5gi0QE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSVLerO3iW0hce_cYfUoJvz8ObU65s8C30_CTSsx9eZPQ&oe=6B0474F0"}, {"file_name": "image5.png", "id": "1245528793651676", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499349371_1245528796985009_3447873084062975841_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lRfHdBoJC1EQ7kNvwHgw8zM&_nc_oc=AdrFvB_bxO8xzrtffbbQs6yEKSX6bwHhQ43_SDT07oYe2ITCHhEH4Rt60cHvIJQWD2w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQf4zzvjdlSMdbwizEvoFyMfNwotSNAcWYUNlsE4AmCJw&oe=6B0473AD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hero360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely during a fire\u2014whether or not a smoke alarm is present. The name \u201cHERO\u201d reflects the purpose of the app: to empower users to become their own hero by learning life-saving reflexes and making the right decisions in a high-risk situation. Surviving a fire starts with knowledge and preparation\u2014HERO 360 gives users the chance to practice that before it\u2019s real.", "short_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely dur